    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Red steel tool chest with an open lid on two stays, a lidded upper tray, four drawers with chrome pulls, side carry handles, a lock barrel and a riveted body. Interior tray walls, hinge hardware and the underside are all modelled, and rust and scratches wrap continuously across panels. A zoomed crop of the front plate reads as descriptive text about ball-bearing drawer runners, not a manufacturer wordmark.",
    "limitations": [
      "Not rigged in the shipped glTF: drawers and lid are fixed in the shown open position.",
      "Drawers are shells without individual contents."
    ],
